Endpoint Purpose Key parameters <code>/api/v1/mobile/payees/list</code> Merchant intelligence — <code>/api/v1/mobile/payees/update</code> Update payee metadata <code>payee_id</code>, plus changed fields <p>One server route has no client caller: <code>/api/v1/mobile/action/undo</code>, which exposes the Odoo action-history undo engine. It is intentionally unused — there is no Desktop UI for it yet.</p> <p>All requests follow the Odoo 18 JSON-RPC envelope:</p> <pre><code>{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "params": {
    "account_id": 14,
    "limit": 100
  }
}
</code></pre>
